.TH L10N-LINT 1 "February 2026" "l10n-lint 1.15.7" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
l10n-lint \- linter for localization files
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B l10n-lint
[\fIOPTIONS\fR] \fIPATH\fR...
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B l10n-lint
checks gettext .po and Qt .ts localization files for common issues:
missing translations, fuzzy entries, placeholder mismatches, and length problems.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show help message and exit.
.TP
.BR \-v ", " \-\-version
Show version number and exit.
.TP
.BR \-g " " \fIREPO\fR ", " \-\-github " " \fIREPO\fR
Analyze GitHub repository. Specify as owner/repo or full URL.
Automatically scans for translation files in the repository.
.TP
.BR \-p " " \fIPATH\fR ", " \-\-path " " \fIPATH\fR
Path filter for GitHub repositories. Limit scanning to specific
subdirectories within the repository.
.TP
.BR \-f " " \fIFORMAT\fR ", " \-\-format " " \fIFORMAT\fR
Output format: text (default), json, html, github, gnu.
The 'gnu' format produces Emacs-compatible file:line:col output.
.TP
.BR \-o " " \fIFILE\fR ", " \-\-output " " \fIFILE\fR
Save the lint report to the specified file instead of stdout.
.TP
.BR \-\-max\-length " " \fIN\fR
Maximum allowed translation length in characters (default: 500).
Translations exceeding this limit are flagged as potentially problematic.
.TP
.BR \-\-no\-recursive
Do not recursively search subdirectories for translation files.
Only process files in the specified directory.
.TP
.BR \-\-strict
Treat warnings as errors. Exit with non-zero status even for
minor issues that would normally be warnings.
.TP
.BR \-q ", " \-\-quiet
Show only summary information. Suppress detailed per-file output
and display only the final statistics.
.TP
.BR \-\-check
Exit code only mode for CI/CD integration. Perform the analysis
but produce no output - only return exit code.
.TP
.BR \-\-skip\-fuzzy
Ignore fuzzy translation entries during analysis. Fuzzy entries
are normally flagged as incomplete translations.
.TP
.BR \-V ", " \-\-verbose
Show detailed progress information during operations.
Displays timing, file sizes, locale detection, and per-file issue counts.
.TP
.BR \-G ", " \-\-gtk
Launch the GTK graphical user interface instead of running
in command-line mode.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
No issues found.
.TP
.B 1
Issues found or error occurred.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
Check all .po files in current directory:
.B l10n-lint .
.TP
Check specific file with JSON output:
.B l10n-lint \-\-format json messages.po
.TP
Skip fuzzy check:
.B l10n-lint \-\-skip fuzzy locale/
.SH AUTHOR
Daniel Nylander <daniel@danielnylander.se>
